 "description": "One entry per asset (Bitcoin, ETH, SOL, USDC, USDT and every other tracked stablecoin, tokenized Treasury and L1) with its best current yield across DeFi and CeFi under BitcoinYield's risk-weighted ranking, its A-D risk grade, and a link to the full comparison. Set max_risk to limit the pick to offers graded at or below that letter (A = lower risk, B = moderate). Rates are variable and not advice. No key required.",
